BACKUP ~InkGallery/backup~
AUTHOR ~Lava Del'Vortel~
VERSION ~v1.5~
README ~InkGallery/readme.txt~

AUTO_TRA ~InkGallery/languages/%s~

ALWAYS
 INCLUDE ~%MOD_FOLDER%/lib/functions.tph~
END

LANGUAGE ~English~
         ~English~
         ~InkGallery/languages/english/setup.tra~

LANGUAGE ~Spanish (by Quasart)~
